From e3d6bc226a29ba866aced8f0fc6353e1f77a6d49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seal <lev.p@sealsecurity.io>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 06:57:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 10.9.0-sp1p1

Baseline sealing changes for the 10.9.0 release: CI/workflow adjustments
(parallel test fan-out, reproducible-artifact build, scope audit/codeql to
the right branches) and test-suite fixups for external drift (orphaned
git-fetcher commit/repo, symlink-aware fixture copy, unpublished
preact-particles peer, POSIX-only child-process cleanup test, cspell entry).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
